mpact/f_%04d.jpg`: **`f = 993..1088`** (`-start_number 993`, audio `ss = 41.333333`, `t = 4.000` — `341 km/h` Laser-Strobe Tunnel `180°` Whip-Orbit -\\u003e `f=1041` Blinding Exit -\\u003e `f=1067..1068` Impact Frame #2!)\\n- `pipeline/v6_sv_comp.py` will also write `v6_spiderverse/v6_shots_manifest.json` with per-frame active camera world positions \\u0026 types (`onboard`, `fixed`, `chase`, `orbit`, `scraper`, `rail`) for optional 3D Doppler lookup.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 16:25:27\",\"request_id\":\"4e621b05-1818-4727-a6ff-7d24ae59eff3\"}],\"head\":33}"}
